# Folders that do not get their own AGENTS.md; they use the nearest
# ancestor's. Gitignore syntax. Dot-folders and gitignored paths are always
# skipped. scripts/checkAgentsMd.ts reads this file.

# Templates of `pnpm new`: data that the generator copies; scripts/AGENTS.md covers them
scripts/templates/

# The Figma references, one data-only folder per page and frame (picture,
# layers, note), written by the fidelity scripts; references/AGENTS.md covers them
references/*/
